Data Sources
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The knowledge graph aggregates data from public scientific data sources
(MathXiv / ArxiTeX, PhysicsBabel, ElementKG 2.0, PubChem, Wikidata, Rhea,
ChEBI, Crossref / OpenAlex, CODATA and others). Such data remains subject to
the terms of its original providers and is not relicensed by this project.
